    <panel_attributes>*Stage 2 class diagram*
Green: class added in Stage 2
Yellow: class changed since the Stage 1 diagram
White: same as in Stage 1
AnthropicSDK (Stage 1) is replaced by AnthropicApi,
our own HTTP client for the Claude Messages API.
Getters, setters, constructors and private helpers
are left out. Every GUI panel also holds the
AgentController (those lines are not drawn).
bg=#FFFFFF</panel_attributes>
    <additional_attributes/>
  </element>
  <element>
    <id>UMLNote</id>
    <coordinates>
      <x>1780</x>
      <y>430</y>
      <w>240</w>
      <h>100</h>
    </coordinates>
    <panel_attributes>*Design patterns*
Facade: AgentController
Adapter: ClaudeClient adapts AnthropicApi to LLMClient
Proxy: LLMClientProxy (daily limit, token count)
Builder: PromptBuilder + 2 concrete builders,
   Prompt = product, RecipeAgent = director
Singleton: NotificationCenter
Command: Command, CookRecipeCommand,
   CommandHistory = invoker (undo)
Strategy: FlyerSource + 2 sources, FlyerService = context
bg=#FFFFFF</panel_attributes>
